            "detailed_description": "Start your own Movie studio in any decade between 1930s and 1990s. Replay the history of Movie Making in this business simulation game. <br />\r\nMake Movies with the best known Actors and Directors of their time. Research new Technologies and create Blockbuster Movies. Make bigger and better studios with state-of-the-art Movie Sets. Train your Actors and Directors to Win Awards. Become the biggest name in Movie Making history. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Start your own Movie Development company in any decade from 1930s to 1990s<br />\r\n- Recruit leading Directors and Actors of their time. Choose from over 50+ Directors and 150+ Actors.<br />\r\n- Make Movies in over 30 Genres and build over 25 sets<br />\r\n- Research industry changing technologies<br />\r\n- Focus on Music, or Sets, or Costume, or Special Effects, or make a Big Budget Blockbuster by focusing on everything<br />\r\n- Win Awards<br />\r\n- Period specific random events to tackle",
